  <section class="pp-motives">
    <div class="pp-motives-left">
      <div class="pp-motive-item">
        <span class="pp-motive-num">01.</span>
        <p class="pp-body">Chess is a unique game in that it takes many forms; there is a traditional set of pieces, but there is also a whole world of custom sets that can take on any form, as long as they have a king, queen, bishop, knight, rook, and pawn.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pp-motive-item">
        <span class="pp-motive-num">02.</span>
        <p class="pp-body">Many adults, young and old, grew up reading Dr. Seuss books and were captivated by his imaginative worlds. I wanted to imbue the traditional game of chess with his whimsical worldbuilding, for people of all ages to enjoy once again.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
